Telephone: +6012 643 7688</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; text-align: center; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify">To Our Stockholders:</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; text-align: justify; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">On January 5, 2024, the Board of Directors of
Treasure Global Inc, a Delaware corporation (the &ldquo;Company&rdquo; or &ldquo;Registrant&rdquo;), unanimously authorized and approved
a reverse split of the issued and outstanding shares of the Company&rsquo;s common stock, par value $0.00001 (the &ldquo;Shares&rdquo;
or &ldquo;Common Stock&rdquo;), at a ratio of any whole number within the range between one-for-ten (1:10) and one-for-seventy (1:70),
with such ratio to be determined in the discretion of the Registrant&rsquo;s Board of Directors and with such action to be effected at
such time and date as determined by the Board of the Directors (the &ldquo;Reverse Split&rdquo;).</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">The Reverse Split was authorized and approved
by the Written Consent of the Board of Directors and Written Consent of the Stockholders holding the majority of the voting power of the
Company, dated January 5, 2024.</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify">This Information Statement will be sent
to you for information purposes only and you are not required to take any action.</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; text-align: justify; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: bold 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: center">We Are Not Asking You for a Proxy
and You are Requested Not To Send Us a Proxy</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; text-align: justify; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt"><B>&nbsp;</B></P>

